with krauts.


00:43:12.548 --> 00:43:13.583
Good luck.


00:43:13.758 --> 00:43:14.998
Thanks.


00:43:15.176 --> 00:43:16.296
All right, let them through.


00:43:16.385 --> 00:43:17.966
Yes, sir.


00:43:49.127 --> 00:43:50.992
